	* glm_inline.h (glmForceMode): New function.  Set glmEnable bit
	  `which' to value specified in `enable'.  Always calls
	  glEnable/glDisable to set OpenGL mode.
	(glmSetMode): New function.  Set glmEnable bit `which' to value
	  specified in `enable'.  Call glEnable/glDisable only if
	  changing.
	(glmDisable): New function.  Disable glmEnable bit `which'.
	(glmEnable): New function.  Enable glmEnable bit `which'.
	(glmPushState): New function.  Push current glmEnable state onto
	  global stack.
	(glmPopState): New function.  Pop current glmEnable state off of
	  global stack.

